@startuml GetLocalPort
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
GetLocalPort – Retrieve Local TCP Server Port
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Server Interface" as tsr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  To retrieve the local port number of the
  TCP server interface.
end note

requestor -> tsr: (none)
activate tsr

tsr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tsr: TCP server LTP list
deactivate jd

note over tsr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Access  TCP server interface  list  
  - Read tcp-server-interface-configuration  
    * local-port  
  - Return local port value  
  - Return undefined if not configured
end note

tsr --> requestor: localPort | undefined
deactivate tsr

@enduml
